use firn/tags

gnome-screenshot is a Module
gnome-screenshot is tagged doom-emacs

nix module
  arguments: config, lib, pkgs, ...
  config when config.myConfig.modules.gnome-screenshot.enable
    "environment"
      "systemPackages": [pkgs.gnome-screenshot]
  option "myConfig"."modules"."gnome-screenshot"."enable": enable "GNOME Screenshot tool"
